<title>GERMANY: KUGELFISCHER H1 GROUP NET FLAT.</title>
<headline>KUGELFISCHER H1 GROUP NET FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>SCHWEINFURT, Germany 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30. (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			  47	 vs 46</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities   77	 vs 58</p>
<p>    Group sales			    1,520	 vs 1,456</p>
<p>    Group orders			   1,592	 vs 1,339</p>
<p>    Group order book		     1,328	 vs 1,314</p>
<p>    Group workforce (number)	  16,089	 vs 16,479</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German ballbearing maker is FAG Kugelfischer Georg Schaefer AG. The company said it expected to improve sales, earnings and cash flow in 1997 on a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
